'''Nishina clan''' (仁科氏) is a Japanese {{ill|samurai clan|ja|武家|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/samurai clan|qq=}}. There are multiple theories about its origins, linking it to both the {{ill|Kammu Taira|ja|桓武平氏|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kammu Taira|qq=}} (Shinano Taira) and the {{ill|Seiwa Genji|ja|清和源氏|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Seiwa Genji|qq=}} (Shinano Genji).

